{"text": "One day a traveling peasant told Pahom about a place beyond the Volga where each man received twenty five acres. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The land there was so rich, he said, that the rye grew as tall as a horse. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why should I suffer in this narrow place, Pahom thought, if I could live so well over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he sold his land and moved his family to the new place, where they got a hundred and twenty five acres. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was ten times better off than before, but after a while even this land did not seem enough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wanted to grow more wheat, so he rented extra land every year, which often led to quarrels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If the land were my own, he thought, I would be free, and there would be no more trouble. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A peasant agreed to sell him thirteen hundred acres for fifteen hundred rubles, and the deal was almost settled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just then a passing dealer told him about the Bashkirs, a simple people living far away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said that he had bought thirteen thousand acres from them for only a thousand rubles.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "a", " ", "t", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", "i", "n", "g", " ", "p", "e", "a", "s", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", " ", "P", "a", "h", "o", "m", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", " ", "b", "e", "y", "o", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "V", "o", "l", "g", "a", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "r", "e", "c", "e", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "f", "i", "v", "e", " ", "a", "c", "r", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "o", " 